518
00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:01.580
I loved it.

519
00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:02.280
It was so fun.

520
00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:04.860
And I thought, oh, I want to maybe do some more of this.

521
00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:09.220
Maybe you don't want to be attached to your stressful watch doing the independent filMs.

522
00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:12.560
I want to do more of these where you just kind of keep it on the rails.

523
00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:12.840
Yeah.

524
00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:17.960
