529
00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:27.460
Remember?

530
00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:31.380
Yes, I did a series there and you edited the film in London.

531
00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:31.860
In London.

532
00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:36.740
So by the time I finally came back to L.A., it was like a year later, you know, and the

533
00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:38.220
office wasn't on the air anymore.

534
00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:40.380
And that's crazy.

535
00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:43.280
Those execs weren't at Fox anymore.

536
00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:45.820
And I kind of missed my moment.

537
00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:46.740
Like, it's hard.

538
00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.980
It's a very hard job to get, like a TV director.

539
00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:49.180
Yeah.

540
00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:51.400
Just job just to be that TV director.

541
00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:52.900
And so I kind of missed my moment.

542
00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:55.400
And it's a regret, you know, it's a regret.

543
00:21:55.600 --> 00:22:01.460
So I guess if anyone out there, if you got Ron Howard tapped up and he can't do it, you

544
00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:02.120
