00:25:16.530 --> 00:25:17.110
Okay.

651
00:25:17.790 --> 00:25:26.030
They said Pam clearly isn't at her desk in those shots, but then at 35 seconds, Pam is at her desk and is wearing Uggs.

652
00:25:26.330 --> 00:25:26.930
Oh.

