00:25:48.650 --> 00:25:57.970
You know, Owen is such a wonderful person, and we reconnected at Phil Shea's memorial and got to talk for a while, and I told him this episode was coming up for us,

662
00:25:58.070 --> 00:25:59.730
and he said he'd love to contribute.

663
00:26:00.190 --> 00:26:04.730
So we sent Owen a few questions, and we're going to share some of his answers throughout the episode.

664
