00:26:25.910 --> 00:26:26.810
And you know what?

671
00:26:26.890 --> 00:26:28.250
Now I kind of love saying it.

672
00:26:28.330 --> 00:26:28.710
Me too.

673
00:26:29.210 --> 00:26:32.410
Finally, for this cold open, we got a fan question from Alexandra T.

674
00:26:32.510 --> 00:26:38.170
