00:26:42.890 --> 00:26:50.790
I'll tell you, Alexandra, we had a crew member sitting on the floor, and they were pulling on the bear with one of those, like, filament wires,

679
00:26:51.090 --> 00:26:54.210
one of those little invisible strings that magicians use.

680
00:26:54.750 --> 00:26:56.110
That's how Beryl fell over.

681
00:26:56.570 --> 00:26:57.610
