See?

2290
01:33:07.390 --> 01:33:07.970
Perfect.

2291
01:33:09.130 --> 01:33:10.050
Oh, no.

2292
01:33:10.430 --> 01:33:10.950
Yeah.

2293
01:33:11.670 --> 01:33:13.370
That was in the shooting draft.

2294
